{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01397",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.64,
      "end_seconds": 4.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.08,
      "end_seconds": 11.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.02,
      "end_seconds": 25.72,
      "duration_seconds": 13.7,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got a red, hot area on my lower leg. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.44,
      "end_seconds": 30.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.1,
      "end_seconds": 35.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "It's been going on for one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.86,
      "end_seconds": 39.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.35,
      "end_seconds": 49.28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.93,
      "text": "Pain in the calf goes along with it, most of the time. About pain in the calf, severe, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.08,
      "end_seconds": 52.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Nothing like chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.43,
      "end_seconds": 55.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "No chest pain, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.98,
      "end_seconds": 62.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "A few quick ones: breathlessness, vomiting or red streaks up the leg?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.61,
      "end_seconds": 68.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.67,
      "end_seconds": 72.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.8,
      "end_seconds": 75.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.82,
      "end_seconds": 79.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.28,
      "end_seconds": 89.62,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.99,
      "end_seconds": 91.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.03,
      "end_seconds": 104.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.62,
      "end_seconds": 119.36,
      "duration_seconds": 13.74,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. I swim twice a week. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.87,
      "end_seconds": 125.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.57,
      "end_seconds": 130.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Right, I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.28,
      "end_seconds": 136.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.31,
      "end_seconds": 141.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "I mean, it's ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.59,
      "end_seconds": 163.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.63,
      "end_seconds": 178.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Right, nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.7,
      "end_seconds": 201.5,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 38.4 degrees, BP is 116 over 78, SpO2 96 percent on room air, pulse 108."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.87,
      "end_seconds": 206.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.21,
      "end_seconds": 210.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.88,
      "end_seconds": 229.6,
      "duration_seconds": 7.72,
      "text": "There is a warm, red, tender patch about ten centimetres across on the right shin with mild swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.79,
      "end_seconds": 233.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "That's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.86,
      "end_seconds": 257.15,
      "duration_seconds": 11.29,
      "text": "Putting it all together, I'd lean towards cellulitis of the right leg. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.79,
      "end_seconds": 259.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.55,
      "end_seconds": 269.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now cellulitis of the right leg is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.43,
      "end_seconds": 305.05,
      "duration_seconds": 24.62,
      "text": "I want blood tests done, that's for skin infection. We'll begin with flucloxacillin, 500 milligrams, four times a day, for seven days. You take it by mouth. That should help with cellulitis. Mark the edge of the redness with a pen and keep the leg raised when sitting. Come back if the redness spreads."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.75,
      "end_seconds": 307.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Alright, I'll be back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.56,
      "end_seconds": 317.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.65,
      "end_seconds": 328.94,
      "duration_seconds": 10.29,
      "text": "So, I take the flucloxacillin, 500 milligrams, four times a day and come back if the redness spreads. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.91,
      "end_seconds": 334.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.52,
      "end_seconds": 339.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.9,
      "end_seconds": 341.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}